# CODEOWNERS for the Pacioli repository.
#
# When a maintainer team is set up on GitHub, replace `ORG/pacioli-maintainers`
# with the actual team handle. Until then, every PR goes to the global
# reviewers list and any maintainer can approve.
#
# To require a specific maintainer for an area, add a line like:
#   /scanner/checks/   @ORG/pacioli-maintainers
# before the more general rule below.
#
# Order matters: later rules override earlier ones for the same path.

# Default: all files require review from any maintainer.
*       @ORG/pacioli-maintainers

# Documentation: anyone can review (no specific owner required).
/docs/

# CI: anyone can review.
/.github/

# Safety model: extra-careful review. Two approvals required for changes
# to lib/safety.sh (enforced by branch protection in repo settings).
/scanner/lib/safety.sh   @ORG/pacioli-maintainers
